$ markoff show work/fix-login-bug
# Fix login bug

- [ ] reproduce
$ markoff edit work/fix-login-bug --append '- [ ] fix'
work/fix-login-bug
$ markoff edit work/write-docs --title 'Write the docs'
work/write-the-docs
$ markoff edit home --name Private
private
$ markoff move work/write-the-docs --top
work/write-the-docs
$ markoff move private/call-bob --to work
work/call-bob
$ markoff move private --before work
private
$ markoff list --filter fix
# Tasks

## work
- Fix login bug (work/fix-login-bug)
